{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/269417-does-this-sound-unreasonable-to-you","id":269417,"title":"Does this sound unreasonable to you?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-30T13:30:12-07:00","id":269417,"title":"Does this sound unreasonable to you?","content":"Hello everyone!<br /> <br /> For my weekly Mortals game, I've got a murderous angel-thing &quot;cleaning up&quot; after an &quot;accident&quot;. I was thinking of statting it out as a &quot;normal&quot; Angel, but I ran into the issue that there are some Embeds and Exploits that fit the &quot;story&quot; of the &quot;Angel&quot; better than most of the Numina (It kinda fell, but it fell <i>wrong</i>. Think Time Angel/Murder Spirit Magath, and you'd be about right).<br /> <br /> So are there any particular issues anyone can see with doing this mechanically? Any particular Embeds/Exploits that'd be outright broken if applied to the Ephemeral Being rules (either broken in the &quot;they don't work&quot; sense, or in the &quot;sweep the field with no survivors&quot; sense)?<br /> <br /> I'm specifically looking at Bystander Effect (Finesse + Rank instead of Manipulation + Intimidate).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T13:35:07-07:00","id":269438,"title":"","content":"Shift Consequence.<br /> <br /> The Embed, that works like an Exploit, and can retroactively redirect anything. It's a tad broken already, even with the risk to Cover. Drop that risk and it is absurdly OP (as opposed to just being very OP).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T13:43:46-07:00","id":269445,"title":"","content":"If you're having trouble... Reassign the Angel's Influences to something that suits your needs more, as you can mix a Numen with an Influence for the basis of most of the things that Embeds are based from... (Feeling I could have worded that better... Basically, Influences can give a 'look' to the Numen an Angel has). If your Angel is feeling a bit weak-sauce, bump up it's Rank. Numen are described pretty simply, but they generally only explain the result of the power being used... How the power is activated and what the Angel does as it uses it, well thats up to you to paint as a picture which it's Influences can really help with.<br /> <br /> I hope this helps <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T13:53:54-07:00","id":269452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/269417-does-this-sound-unreasonable-to-you?p=269445#post269445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you're having trouble... Reassign the Angel's Influences to something that suits your needs more, as you can mix a Numen with an Influence for the basis of most of the things that Embeds are based from... (Feeling I could have worded that better... Basically, Influences can give a 'look' to the Numen an Angel has). If your Angel is feeling a bit weak-sauce, bump up it's Rank. Numen are described pretty simply, but they generally only explain the result of the power being used... How the power is activated and what the Angel does as it uses it, well thats up to you to paint as a picture which it's Influences can really help with.<br /> <br /> I hope this helps <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the case is that I specifically want some of the mechanical effects of some Embeds/Exploits (there's no real equivalent to stuff like Bystander Effect, at least that I can think of).<br /> <br /> I might as well go ahead and write some Numina, tho.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T14:00:42-07:00","id":269477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/269417-does-this-sound-unreasonable-to-you?p=269452#post269452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, the case is that I specifically want some of the mechanical effects of some Embeds/Exploits (there's no real equivalent to stuff like Bystander Effect, at least that I can think of).<br /> <br /> I might as well go ahead and write some Numina, tho.</div> </div> </div> </div>In some writeups in Demon, we've seen Cryptids and Angels with Numina that say stuff like Bystander Effect (as Embed) and Embeds are powers that Demons remember from before the Fall, so they're powers Angels are capable of possessing. Conversely, Angels can't have Exploits, however they may have Numena which accomplish the same/similar goals. Resurrection is the chief example for that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T14:23:18-07:00","id":269498,"title":"","content":"Hmm...<br /> <br /> Thanks. I'll think about that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}